<title>HONDURAS: ACPC plans coffee promotion in Russia, China.</title>
<headline>ACPC plans coffee promotion in Russia, China.</headline>
<dateline>TEGUCIGALPA, Honduras 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Association of Coffee Producing Countries (ACPC) plans to start coffee drinking promotions in countries such as Russia and China to boost consumption, a top Honduran coffee official said Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Massive campaigns are under study for countries such as Russia and China, among others, with the objective of promoting coffee...&quot; Fernando Montes, of the Honduran Coffee Institute, said.</p>
<p>Montes said ACPC nations discussed the promotions plan at a recent meeting in London. He gave no details when the promotions might start or how the producer nations intend to carry out the campaign.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530)) E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
